      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In this paper, we present a study on the repulsive Haldane-Hubbard model with spin-rotation symmetry in square lattices by deriving non-linear σ model for magnetic states. It is found that a chiral spin liquid state as the ground state of the correlated system exists in the [Formula: see text] topological spin-density wave proposed by Wu et al (2016 J. Phys.: Condens. Matter 28 115602), of which the low energy physics can be determined by the Chern-Simons-Hopf gauge field theory."},
